            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Had a friend over for lunch today and served this. \"WOW,\" is what we said. This simple little carrot salad is loaded with flavor, and on top of that, it's so darn easy AND healthy for you (41 calories, 1.2g fat &amp; 7.2g carbs). Admittedly, you have to like cilantro (we do), but this was such a pleasant surprise. I've not eaten much Indian food, but bring it on!"
          },
          {
