              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Katie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy, pretty, and tasty! Try to find Asian cilantro instead of 'parsley cilantro'. Makes a big difference to the taste. Also, avoid over stirring as you want the salad to remain as fresh looking as possible.",
