              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tall Timbers Kook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is a winner. Made it as written first time, and found it a touch salty, so I cut back on that the next time. Today I was short on cilantro, only had 1/4 cup...so I used 1/4 cup of mint also. Still a winner. I think this is recipe that you can tweak to fit your individual taste, all the while enjoying a healthy treat. I can't wait to use this as a sandwich topping and loved scooping it up with sweet pepper spears!",
            "datePublished": "2014-07-06T10:37:43.270Z"
